  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "Our bedroom is bright this morning, but dirty clothes lie on the floor beside the basket. My brother and I decide to help each other before we play. I move the chair away from the desk so my brother has room to clean the desk with water. He works near the lamp while I look for a place for my toy. The closet is open, so I put the toy in the drawer beside it. Then we pick up the clothes and carry the full basket to the door. We check the shelf and make sure every book is in its place. On the bed, we put the pillow beside the blanket and leave both ready for tonight. I open the window for a little air, and we look around our tidy room with a smile.",
    "textZh": "今天早上我們的臥室很明亮，但籃子旁的地板上有髒衣服。哥哥和我決定先互相幫忙，再一起玩。我把椅子從書桌旁挪開，讓哥哥有空間用水擦書桌。他在檯燈旁工作，我則替玩具找個收納位置。衣櫥開著，所以我把玩具放進旁邊的抽屜。接著我們撿起衣服，把裝滿衣物的籃子搬到門邊。我們檢查架子，確認每本書都放在原位。我們在床上把枕頭放在毛毯旁，準備好晚上使用。我打開窗戶，讓一點空氣進來；我們微笑著看看整潔的房間。",
